No.


01:10:26.360 --> 01:10:27.759
Are you going?


01:11:25.320 --> 01:11:26.639
Wait.


01:11:34.160 --> 01:11:35.957
You're ok.


01:12:16.920 --> 01:12:20.674
Come. Let's go.
-I can't leave yet.


01:12:20.880 --> 01:12:23.553
Come.
-I am staying.


01:12:23.800 --> 01:12:25.472
All by yourself?


01:12:26.360 --> 01:12:28.112
I am not alone.


01:12:28.680 --> 01:12:30.796
Someone is waiting for me.


01:12:32.960 --> 01:12:35.155
Are you sure she will?


01:12:41.960 --> 01:12:45.350
Come home.
Nobody likes her.


01:12:46.000 --> 01:12:46.830
Bye.


01:12:47.840 --> 01:12:49.592
What are you doing?
-Nothing.


01:12:49.800 --> 01:12:52.473
Come with me.
-I like it here.


01:12:59.160 --> 01:13:00.878
What's up?


01:13:08.160 --> 01:13:10.196
I want to ask you something.


01:13:23.680 --> 01:13:24.999
Come here.


01:13:28.920 --> 01:13:29.989
Come, Marie.


01:14:17.280 --> 01:14:18.759
You see...


01:14:19.760 --> 01:14:21.955
That wasn't so hard.


01:14:38.120 --> 01:14:39.951
I'm going back.


01:14:47.960 --> 01:14:49.791
He isn't half bad, eh?


01:14:55.880 --> 01:14:58.917
If he turns out te be an ass,
will you come save me?


01:18:13.200 --> 01:18:19.200
SUBS by N4N4

